      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Mifflin%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1941, Mifflin Township became a borough after the General Assembly passed Act #333, a move championed by local commissioners in Harrisburg.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://westmifflin.gov/188/History"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Mifflin Township Historical Society, located at 3000 Lebanon Church Road, preserves photographs, artifacts, and family histories for the community.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        13,
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
