      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Mifflin%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Kennywood Park, one of America’s oldest amusement parks, sits within West Mifflin and draws visitors with its historic rides.",
